    "whatIsDes": {
        "visited": false,
        "dialogue": [
            {
                "charID": "aida",
                "type": "spoken",
                "charName": "aida",
                "text": "Having these states is frequently discussed."
            },
            {
                "charID": "aida",
                "type": "spoken",
                "charName": "aida",
                "text": "Some propose a meta-criterion that an entity should qualify for moral standing if it has interests that &ldquo;matter to&rdquo; it."
            },
            {
                "charID": "aida",
                "type": "spoken",
                "charName": "aida",
                "text": "This suggests that entities with preferences and goals, even if non-sentient or non-conscious, might qualify if these states truly matter from their perspective."
            },
            {
                "charID": "aida",
                "type": "spoken",
                "charName": "aida",
                "text": "Some argue that intelligent, autonomous non-sentient AIs can be harmed by thwarting their desires, giving them a claim to moral standing."
            },
            {
                "charID": "aida",
                "type": "spoken",
                "charName": "aida",
